4bc1763117284.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":146},{"title":"Detroit: Become Human","target":"https://www.quanticdream.com/en/detroit-become-human","line":150},{"title":"![Screenshot from the game Stellaris","target":"https://img.mezha.ua/mezhaprod/system/MediaPhoto/photo/7/d/285126/7d02ecbf4688e8c043ecbdc3c42019091763117313.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":160},{"title":"Stellaris","target":"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/stellaris/","line":164},{"title":"![Screenshot from the game Road 96","target":"https://img.mezha.ua/mezhaprod/system/MediaPhoto/photo/0/2/285127/0258d95b5c260004d875094d255bc78e1763117488.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":172},{"title":"Road 96","target":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/169445/road-96/","line":176},{"title":"donated money to help Ukraine","target":"https://mezha.ua/en/2024/07/12/polish-11-bit-studios-donates-50-thousand-for-children-treated-at-okhmatdyt-this-is-a-share-of-the-profits-from-the-russian-game-indika/","line":188},{"title":"![Statement from the developers of This War of Mine regarding the Russian invasion of Ukraine","target":"https://img.mezha.ua/mezhaprod/system/MediaPhoto/photo/1/2/285128/12955054fb41a8a9bec33e1f297489af1763117560.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":190},{"title":"![Screenshot from the game Metal Gear Rising: Revengeance","target":"https://img.mezha.ua/mezhaprod/system/MediaPhoto/photo/2/d/285129/2d62fd690c309411c23009061ca586a61763117578.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":198},{"title":"criticism of woke culture","target":"https://mezha.ua/en/articles/a-conspiracy-theory-in-the-gaming-industry-western-game-developers-are-accused-of-promoting-woke-values-what-is-sweet-baby-inc-and-what-is-going-on/","line":210},{"title":"America's Army","target":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/7640/americas-army-operations/","line":214},{"title":"![Art from the game Fallout: New Vegas","target":"https://img.mezha.ua/mezhaprod/system/MediaPhoto/photo/b/b/285130/bb97b5d83231104e851628c233dc28a81763117642.jpg?w=1920&q=90&f=webp","line":216}],"metadata":{"title":"Ideology and Entertainment: Video Games as Political Manifestos","source":"https://mezha.ua/en/articles/videoigri-yak-politichni-manifesti-306305/","author":["[[Mykyta Kazymyrov]]"],"published":"2025-11-15","created":"2026-03-31","description":"Modern video games are not just fun entertainment and interesting stories. They are system simulators, experience architects, and, most importantly, decision-making simulators. They have evolved into a full-fledged platform for political influence.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1v6gkx4","at":1780884641190},"key":"Clippings/Ideology and Entertainment Video Games as Political Manifestos.md"},
